{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>新皇崗口岸啟用近兩周，入境處新增合作查驗「e-道」登記站，方便市民登記。</p><p></p><p>新增登記站位於5樓離境層，尚未用「香港E道」手機應用程式登記的市民，可帶同7至17歲子女即場辦理。入境處處長郭俊峯等到口岸視察運作情況。入境處指，會繼續監察客流和車流，優化細節。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:03:01.646892+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:18:10.214388+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:58:12.844212+00:00","content_hash":"6246dcd1fabab61be6bc14dcda1a7ab42f877dbd2943f49b0f1f5d6c8639bee1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:03:01.646892+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}